Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah sampai.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jenderal!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kau tersesat lagi!\NMuntah di situ saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.02,0:00:26.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, bukankah kita mau ke Air Terjun Kegon?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.77,0:00:28.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita berkumpul dengan yang lain dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami menemukan bangunan kecil terbengkalai\Ndi pegunungan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk sementara, ini markas kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.45,0:00:40.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masuklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh! Apa ini Ichinose?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.06,0:02:28.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Coba kulihat. Seperti apa wajahmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berengsek...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Singkirkan tanganmu dariku!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.78,0:02:37.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa melihat?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.45,0:02:44.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Matamu berfungsi, tapi kau tetap\Ntak bisa melihat apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.06,0:02:48.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetap saja, aku suka rasanya menyentuhmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum dewasa, ketus, dan keras kepala!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.25,0:02:52.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak mau mengakui perasaanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.63,0:02:54.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ada sesuatu yang sangat polos\Ndalam dirimu!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kuraba seluruh tubuhmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.46,0:02:57.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mesum!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bukan Ichinose!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.55,0:03:00.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.35,0:03:08.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membawanya kemari\Ntanpa menanyakan namanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.06,0:03:10.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.31,0:03:12.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi bergabung dengan kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Umitsuki Miyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian para pria, jangan menatapku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Todomeki Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kuraba kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otohara Kyotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.82,0:03:25.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih ada tiga orang lagi,\Ntapi mereka belum kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.20,0:03:30.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Keturunan Kishin, sih, lain cerita,\Ntapi apa orang ini berguna dalam pertarungan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau coba?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, kalian para pria,\Njangan menatapku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau akan kucabut anumu\Ndan kujejalkan ke tenggorokanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.96,0:03:40.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, jangan bertengkar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rambutku bisa rontok semua.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi itu penting, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.55,0:03:47.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita perlu menentukan pembagian tugas.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kemampuanmu, Yaoroshi?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menciptakan senjata.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.98,0:03:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku tak tahu senjata\Napa yang akan muncul.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.27,0:03:59.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tergantung seberapa marah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.74,0:04:01.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.11,0:04:04.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang ada unsur untung-untungan,\Ntapi itu kemampuan tempur, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.99,0:04:05.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.37,0:04:10.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, sekali lagi terima kasih\Nkarena sudah bergabung!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senang bisa bertemu teman baru!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kuperjelas satu hal.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.50,0:04:18.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kemari bukan untuk berteman.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.13,0:04:21.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian melakukan hal yang ingin kulakukan.\NHanya itu alasanku datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.76,0:04:25.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita cuma sekutu, bukan teman.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.39,0:04:27.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingat itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Sikapnya angkuh sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Persis seperti Umitsuki waktu baru bergabung!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.77,0:04:35.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian para pria, jangan menatapku.\NAtau kucungkil mata kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah ada yang mendahuluimu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.48,0:04:42.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa Jenderal selalu dikelilingi\Norang-orang aneh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.90,0:04:46.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi orang tengah memang berat, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, bantu aku, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak bisa! Itu tugasmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.79,0:04:55.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sudah kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami pulang!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.67,0:05:03.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa itu? Ichinose?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.42,0:05:04.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teman baru kita...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.05,0:05:07.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudku, sekutu! Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.68,0:05:09.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekutu? Maksudnya apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa kau sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Fuwa Shinichi!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.56,0:05:16.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan di sebelahnya, Kakoi Misaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seram.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan memelototiku seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kepalamu tertembus panah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.07,0:05:28.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria yang angkuh?\NPaling menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wanita bersuami yang lebih tua dan angkuh?\NSempurna.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wanita yang lebih tua?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.37,0:05:35.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak kapan kita mulai membicarakan\Nnenek-nenek?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh. Salah langkah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nenek-nenek?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.34,0:05:44.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Arahnya berubah?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.14,0:05:51.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sebut mereka nenek-nenek, Anak Baru.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menghentikannya begitu saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.64,0:05:56.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, Misaki, jangan mengincar istri orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wanita berusia 40 tahun ke bawah\Nbahkan tak masuk hitunganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan soal umur. Ini soal lekuk tubuh!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.97,0:06:04.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cinta tidak dimulai\Ndari berat badan tiga digit.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.45,0:06:06.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka ini
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.70,0:06:07.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak paham selera kalian\Nyang suka wanita gemuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tak paham seleramu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.49,0:06:13.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, 'kan, Anak Baru?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.62,0:06:18.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu hanya dengan menyentuhnya!\NYaoroshi masih perjaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.33,0:06:20.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Kau masih perjaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Obrolan yang bodoh.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi serius? Benarkah?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.63,0:06:27.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kau menilai reaksinya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.59,0:06:29.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Obrolan bodoh? Aku ikut!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia jelas polos, sangat polos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahil dia masih perjaka\Ndengan hormon remaja sebegitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja aku masih perjaka!\NKau bodoh, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Kenapa kau marah soal itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.27,0:06:45.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga. Kalian tidak tahu\Nkalau harus menunggu sampai umur 20?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.40,0:06:50.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa-apaan bocah polos ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, kau pernah berpegangan tangan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.91,0:06:54.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu nanti setelah menikah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.29,0:06:55.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ciuman?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.91,0:06:59.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bisa bikin hamil!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,K-Kau tahu apa itu perjaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa-apaan, sih?\NBerhenti menggangguku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.46,0:07:06.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang belum pernah\Nmelakukan "itu", 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana pendapatmu soal konten X?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.05,0:07:11.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Itu cuma huruf!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jenderal, orang ini lucu sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.56,0:07:20.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak yang mau kami tunjukkan padamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita mulai dari koleksi pribadiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar temuan berharga!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.44,0:07:27.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihat? Sudah kubilang! Dia sangat polos!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.78,0:07:30.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apanya yang lucu?\NSingkirkan tanganmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.86,0:07:34.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa menahannya!\NMarah pun kau tetap menggemaskan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.33,0:07:36.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Persetan! Lepaskan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya bersemangat sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang bertambah satu lagi\Norang yang berisik.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Kau tampak keren!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.17,0:07:52.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang kau terlihat\Nseperti bagian dari kami!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.13,0:07:53.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bukan bagian dari kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.64,0:07:57.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma belum kembali,\Ntapi mari kita mulai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.14,0:07:58.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, bagaimana hasil pengintaiannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.27,0:08:03.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini, soal laboratorium itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.77,0:08:09.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,hari kita menyerbu ke sana bisa jadi\Nhari kematian kita semua.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, rumornya benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.82,0:08:15.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yakin itu laboratorium Momotaro?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.49,0:08:18.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Bangunannya berdiri\Ntepat di bekas lokasi Air Terjun Kegon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tempatnya juga cukup mengesankan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tingginya sepuluh lantai.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.67,0:08:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin kapal udara di atapnya\Ndipakai untuk mengangkut barang?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai kita punya denah bangunannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada, kok. Walau hanya sebagian.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku punya denah kasar area pintu masuknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga kau bisa diandalkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.43,0:08:42.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si kecil-kecil ini yang bekerja keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.07,0:08:49.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rekrutan baru kita, Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.49,0:08:52.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Hirunuma!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.32,0:08:55.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti yang kau lihat,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.83,0:08:58.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,kemampuannya memungkinkan dia\Nmenyimpan lintah di dalam tubuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.33,0:09:02.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurut si kecil-kecil ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.83,0:09:05.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada pintu keamanan yang kokoh\Ndi setiap lantai laboratorium.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Area-area pentingnya sepertinya\Nada di balik pintu-pintu itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa sebenarnya yang mereka teliti?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tak bisa melewati pintunya,\Njadi aku tak bisa memastikannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.22,0:09:18.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi mereka melihat\Nada mayat yang diangkut keluar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.47,0:09:21.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mayat? Oni?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.81,0:09:22.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.35,0:09:27.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa mereka menjadikan Oni tawanan\Nsebagai bahan penelitian.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.36,0:09:32.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, kita juga harus membebaskan\NOni yang mereka tahan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.23,0:09:35.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tak berhak mempermainkan\Nnyawa Oni sesuka hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.99,0:09:39.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, ini pertanyaan pentingnya.\NSiapa yang akan kita hadapi?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.62,0:09:44.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan laboratorium sebesar itu,\Nmungkin ada sampai tiga kapten.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan wakil kapten dalam jumlah yang sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enam petarung kuat Momotaro,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,ditambah mungkin 400 atau 500 prajurit\Nbawahan mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.88,0:09:56.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sementara kita cuma delapan orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.34,0:10:00.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Itu, sih, misi bunuh diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.14,0:10:01.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang harus kita lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada bedanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.98,0:10:08.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski kalah jumlah telak,\Ntujuan kita adalah memusnahkan Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita tak boleh gentar karena jumlah mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.32,0:10:15.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi kalau mereka memperlakukan Oni\Nseperti tikus percobaan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.74,0:10:22.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik, kita berpencar dan gunakan saluran sampah\Ndi ruang bawah tanah untuk mencapai tiap lantai.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, kita bergerak diam-diam.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita menyerang larut malam ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Istirahatlah sampai saat itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.75,0:10:28.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.38,0:10:37.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muda-sen, masih berapa jauh lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekitar dua jam.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.05,0:10:42.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jalur gunung malam-malam begini menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.26,0:10:45.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Guru, lihat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.77,0:10:55.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu ada permukiman di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.19,0:10:58.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, tetap waspada.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lukamu parah!\NKau baik-baik saja, Pak?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.68,0:11:21.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putriku...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.68,0:11:22.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.22,0:11:27.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putriku... mereka menculiknya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.68,0:11:28.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.81,0:11:29.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Remi...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Pak! Bertahanlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.95,0:11:33.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita bawa dia ke salah satu rumah ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik! Kita juga harus mencari dokter.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.32,0:11:37.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.99,0:11:43.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa tak ada lagi orang di permukiman ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita tinjau ulang rutenya\Ndan bersiap menghadapi masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.81,0:12:16.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpamu, aku pasti sudah botak karena stres.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak bisa tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.64,0:12:48.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak bisa tidur?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedang apa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sedang memikirkan\Nrekan-rekanku yang gugur.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.65,0:12:56.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rekan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.27,0:13:01.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang-orang yang punya tujuan sama\Ndengan kami, yaitu memusnahkan Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku takut tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.53,0:13:11.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat bahagia\Nsaat bersama mereka di dalam mimpi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.41,0:13:14.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin tinggal di sana selamanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.67,0:13:17.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku tahu itu tak mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.09,0:13:22.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita memejamkan mata dan bermimpi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.92,0:13:26.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, kita harus membukanya\Ndan mewujudkan mimpi itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.10,0:13:32.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, setiap malam aku memikirkan\Nrekan-rekan yang telah gugur.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpa sadar, matahari sudah terbit.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.56,0:13:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak sekali yang ingin\Nkusampaikan pada mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.69,0:13:45.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.75,0:13:57.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak mau mengalami itu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.46,0:14:00.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah kehilangan banyak orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kau masih sanggup\Nmencari teman baru?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.10,0:14:12.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa menyusun rencana.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.97,0:14:15.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bukan pemikir hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.60,0:14:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma bisa menyerbu di barisan depan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, aku butuh rekan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, aku takut sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.78,0:14:30.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu kau tahu betapa berartinya\Nmemiliki orang-orang di sisimu,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.49,0:14:32.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau tak akan bisa kembali sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.54,0:14:34.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita semua sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita masing-masing memikul beban.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.75,0:14:40.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kita masih punya sesuatu\Nyang ingin kita capai.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.88,0:14:44.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, kita berkumpul\Ndan saling mendukung.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua orang butuh sandaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.51,0:14:55.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana bisa kau menerima kematian temanmu\Ndan melangkah maju begitu saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.52,0:14:57.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kita harus terus maju.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.64,0:15:02.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harapan rekan-rekan kita yang gugur\Nmasih hidup dalam diri kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, kita harus menuntaskannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.03,0:15:10.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya kita yang masih hidup\Nyang bisa mewujudkan harapan mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.75,0:15:19.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terserah. Aku tak peduli.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.79,0:15:20.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah. Istirahatlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.83,0:15:56.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bilang putrimu diculik.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.45,0:16:00.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak. Lupakan ucapanku tadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau Oni, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu dari lukamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.34,0:16:07.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lukamu parah, tapi pulihnya terlalu cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oni? Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.47,0:16:10.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami juga Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.93,0:16:18.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Enomoto Tetsuji.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.56,0:16:25.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tinggal di sini bersama putriku, Remi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.19,0:16:29.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permukiman ini bermula\Nsaat sekelompok Oni menetap di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.07,0:16:35.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian dengar soal insiden gas beracun\Ndi dekat Air Terjun Kegon?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beritanya sempat muncul di TV.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Area di sekitar air terjun ditutup.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.37,0:16:44.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami berada tepat di luar zona terlarang,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi penduduk manusia\Nketakutan dan mengungsi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.13,0:16:50.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu justru menguntungkan bagi kami para Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami berusaha menjaga jarak dari manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.34,0:16:57.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi entah kenapa,\Nair terjunnya berhenti mengalir.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.10,0:17:00.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, fasilitas penelitian aneh\Nberdiri di tempatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Aku pernah ke sana waktu SMP!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya air terjun bisa\Nberhenti begitu saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.98,0:17:06.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan bukan itu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.23,0:17:12.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada permukiman Oni lain lebih jauh ke dalam.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.36,0:17:16.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suatu hari,\Nsemua penghuninya lenyap begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.87,0:17:21.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oni memang sering berpindah-pindah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.12,0:17:24.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi semuanya sekaligus? Itu aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.12,0:17:28.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Beberapa orang di sini juga curiga\Nlalu pindah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya kami juga pergi waktu itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.76,0:17:36.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum lama ini,\Nsegerombolan Momotaro menyerang kami!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga ini berbahaya!\NAyo pulang!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.35,0:17:42.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi bisa kita jemput lain kali!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.43,0:17:45.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam! Kita tak akan meninggalkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.23,0:17:48.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berusaha membawa putriku\Nkabur dari sini, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.65,0:17:52.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah! Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.53,0:17:57.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Remi... lari.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Remi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.41,0:18:07.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yo. Masih hidup?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.42,0:18:09.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang harus kita lakukan dengan pria ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.29,0:18:10.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Lepaskan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.04,0:18:14.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oni pun tak akan selamat\Ndengan luka seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bawa saja anaknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Remi!\N- Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.43,0:18:22.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Laporkan pada Ketua.\N- Ayah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami sudah mendapatkan bahan yang dia minta.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.52,0:18:32.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Bahan." Begitulah dia menyebut mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.94,0:18:35.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oni dijadikan bahan? Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, itu sebabnya mereka\Nditangkap hidup-hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.82,0:18:42.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Mereka membawa semuanya\Nke laboratorium itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Remi tak akan keluar dari sana tanpa terluka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi-lagi para Momotaro berengsek itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.71,0:18:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tahu ada yang tidak beres,\Ntapi tetap tidak pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.09,0:18:56.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga ikut bersalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.59,0:18:59.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Aku... Yah...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.09,0:19:00.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Hentikan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.64,0:19:02.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Dasar kejam.\N- Ck, ck!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu kenyataannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini benar-benar\Ntak tahu kapan harus diam, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.39,0:19:07.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dulu punya istri.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.35,0:19:11.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia jatuh sakit dan meninggal.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.77,0:19:16.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dulu kami sekeluarga\Nsetiap hari mengunjungi Air Terjun Kegon.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan setelah istriku meninggal,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami tetap ke sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.74,0:19:23.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putriku...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.49,0:19:28.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putriku yakin air terjun itu\Nsuatu hari akan muncul kembali!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada begitu banyak
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenangan kami di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.30,0:19:42.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa ini harus terjadi pada kami?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.91,0:19:44.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tak pernah membunuh siapa pun!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.94,0:19:49.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tinggal jauh dari orang-orang\Nagar tak melukai mereka saat lepas kendali!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.14,0:19:52.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, kenapa? Kenapa kami harus diburu\Nhanya karena kami Oni?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.77,0:19:55.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Remi baru berusia enam tahun!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.94,0:20:01.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada yang berhak merampas masa depannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.11,0:20:03.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak seorang pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muda-sen.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi pergi ke laboratorium itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.91,0:20:10.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemungkinan besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, toh kita memang akan ke sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.92,0:20:18.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak, kami akan merebut kembali\Napa yang mereka ambil darimu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putrimu dan masa depannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.09,0:20:24.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sok memimpin.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.30,0:20:27.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Kita benar-benar akan pergi?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.31,0:20:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini tak ada bantahan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.02,0:20:30.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku setuju.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.94,0:20:33.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,K-Kalian serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.06,0:20:35.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tempat itu pasti penuh Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian bisa mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tak akan mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.79,0:20:50.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pukul 02.00.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.66,0:20:51.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serbu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.19,0:22:40.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu muatan terakhir hari ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.69,0:22:42.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau merokok dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.82,0:22:44.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau ke bawah sana lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.94,0:22:47.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada orang.\NTempat yang pas untuk merokok.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.45,0:22:51.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, terima kasih.\NTempat itu bikin merinding.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.16,0:22:59.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya apa yang dia takutkan?
